    /// Read a pick proof by stable id, with the response's `ETag`.
    ///
    /// `GET /api/v1/pick-of-the-day/ledger/{pick_id}`
    ///
    /// [`Self::get_pick_of_the_day_ledger_entry`], returning the `ETag` validator the response carried beside
